{
  "title": "Werracle: Sub-Cent Intra-Block AI Reflex Oracles and Flash-Loan Circuit Breakers for EVM Smart Contracts",
  "description": "Production-grade, zero-storage on-chain AI decision oracle fitting inside a single 32-byte EVM storage slot. Eliminates multi-gigabyte neural weight matrices and high-latency ZK-ML provers by procedurally evaluating 16-point Pareto micro-grids using Q16.16 fixed-point arithmetic in standard EVM bytecode (~21,438 gas, <1ms latency). Features Uniswap v4 chaos-adaptive dynamic fee governor hooks (WerracleFeeHook.sol) and a 1,000-test cryptographically sealed deterministic verification suite.",
